      "title": "Bioinformatics, Birthdays, and Booze at Boston BOSC.",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>Birthdays are always emotional. The &lt;em&gt; GigaScience &lt;/em&gt; team are on their way back from the always jam packed ISMB meeting and its satellite SIGs. This year was a particularly event filled one, with our second birthday, the BMC open data award and drinks reception, and our \"What Bioinformaticians need to know about digital publishing beyond the PDF2\" workshop all falling during the meeting.</jats:p>",
